        "original_id": "08b82b2d-82cc-5bf9-9738-4633557ed6de",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: The Circle (2013 novel), The Circle (2017 film)\n- People: James Ponsoldt, Dave Eggers, Emma Watson, Tom Hanks, John Boyega, Karen Gillan, Ellar Coltrane, Patton Oswalt, Glenne Headly, Bill Paxton\n- Topics: adaptation, casting, final performance\n\nFacts:\n- Dave Eggers wrote The Circle, a dystopian novel published in 2013.\n- The Circle is a 2017 American techno-thriller film based on Dave Eggers's 2013 novel of the same name.\n- James Ponsoldt directed The Circle and co-wrote the film with Dave Eggers.\n- The Circle stars Emma Watson, Tom Hanks, John Boyega, Karen Gillan, Ellar Coltrane, Patton Oswalt, Glenne Headly, and Bill Paxton.\n- The Circle was released shortly after Bill Paxton died in February 2017.\n- The Circle is the final performance of Bill Paxton's career.",
